{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":48315,\"title\":\"Time Runner\",\"tagline\":\"A world under attack.  A hero battling to change destiny.\",\"overview\":\"During the alien invasion of 2022, one man flees through a wormhole to 1992, where attempt after attempt is made to catch and kill him.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mWUmoHHJ5CJF8xI6UJQa5ZxTNOl.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pJ5hsNlil3iJez2DP9DIxCytELR.jpg\",\"rating\":4.4,\"voteCount\":31,\"year\":1993,\"runtime\":90,\"genres\":[\"Science Fiction\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"CA\",\"name\":\"Canada\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Michael Mazo\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":140254,\"name\":\"Michael Mazo\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"Mark Hamill\",\"character\":\"Michael Raynor\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zMQ93JTLW8KxusKhOlHFZhih3YQ.jpg\"},{\"id\":13312,\"name\":\"Rae Dawn Chong\",\"character\":\"Karen Donaldson\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aj9fFFKH3QZX2FSJsj81I4y12M7.jpg\"},{\"id\":591,\"name\":\"Brion James\",\"character\":\"Neila\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qy5jIIsWrNCV1OVRaUiqYNhLLVT.jpg\"},{\"id\":1915192,\"name\":\"Mark Baur\",\"character\":\"Freeman\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1235366,\"name\":\"Gordon Tipple\",\"character\":\"Arnie\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/v7tMsAOE6T7g1hG3fsDtL0hAQqr.jpg\"},{\"id\":21021,\"name\":\"John Maclaren\",\"character\":\"Carl Withers\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/deFq2FqpyUoMes9Jlm7kzP671I1.jpg\"},{\"id\":1234922,\"name\":\"Barry W. Levy\",\"character\":\"Bryant\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ucmszxRXA8Jk9W59mFtyRWa6ZHi.jpg\"},{\"id\":75529,\"name\":\"Suzy Joachim\",\"character\":\"Dorothy Raynor\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jskeqLKa3diJFvOhyotzSgwU88g.jpg\"},{\"id\":2654125,\"name\":\"Allan Forget\",\"character\":\"Murphy\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":3732563,\"name\":\"John Thomas\",\"character\":\"Simms\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1366512,\"name\":\"Guyle Fraizer\",\"character\":\"Pod Scientist\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4SLcW2WnvLcHnAewiWsMjY6YUnz.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1101383,\"title\":\"The End of Oak Street\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7DmtuAK5gYGlMFA45Oxkl1bEpIC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w9AiymbmQGt3jdtsm78HdfKkChy.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a mysterious cosmic event rips Oak Street from suburbia and transports their neighborhood to someplace unknown, the Platt family soon discovers that their very survival depends on them sticking together as they navigate their now unrecognizable surroundings.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":299534,\"title\":\"Avengers: Endgame\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jtDv3lCnST0fZRvdYFwR5CVwK2x.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7RyHsO4yDXtBv1zUU3mTpHeQ0d5.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After the devastating events of Avengers: Infinity War, the universe is in ruins due to the efforts of the Mad Titan, Thanos. With the help of remaining allies, the Avengers must assemble once more in order to undo Thanos' actions and restore order to the universe once and for all, no matter what consequences may be in store.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":157336,\"title\":\"Interstellar\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yQvGrMoipbRoddT0ZR8tPoR7NfX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8sNiAPPYU14PUepFNeSNGUTiHW.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The adventures of a group of explorers who make use of a newly discovered wormhole to surpass the limitations on human space travel and conquer the vast distances involved in an interstellar voyage.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":577922,\"title\":\"Tenet\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rrKH3VhHssGTCfPuaEQkxvEoElv.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mQOUyqDybTqxl73hO5LujCZsM1o.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Armed with only one word - Tenet - and fighting for the survival of the entire world, the Protagonist journeys through a twilight world of international espionage on a mission that will unfold in something beyond real time.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":127585,\"title\":\"X-Men: Days of Future Past\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tYfijzolzgoMOtegh1Y7j2Enorg.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3czpqXzFy5UcNuD1AubecRLWkwD.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The ultimate X-Men ensemble fights a war for the survival of the species across two time periods as they join forces with their younger selves in an epic battle that must change the past – to save our future.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":137113,\"title\":\"Edge of Tomorrow\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nBM9MMa2WCwvMG4IJ3eiGUdbPe6.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4V1yIoAKPMRQwGBaSses8Bp2nsi.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Major Bill Cage is an officer who has never seen a day of combat when he is unceremoniously demoted and dropped into combat. Cage is killed within minutes, managing to take an alpha alien down with him. He awakens back at the beginning of the same day and is forced to fight and die again... and again - as physical contact with the alien has thrown him into a time loop.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":298618,\"title\":\"The Flash\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rktDFPbfHfUbArZ6OOOKsXcv0Bm.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yF1eOkaYvwiORauRCPWznV9xVvi.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When his attempt to save his family inadvertently alters the future, Barry Allen becomes trapped in a reality in which General Zod has returned and there are no Super Heroes to turn to. In order to save the world that he is in and return to the future that he knows, Barry's only hope is to race for his life. But will making the ultimate sacrifice be enough to reset the universe?\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1119449,\"title\":\"Good Luck, Have Fun, Don't Die\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rWcfOdY7TU6lTdazWj0ebDZnAfO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/drRxbu2OHG0DEENptZ8wI5f0uEU.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A 'Man from the Future' arrives at an LA diner where he must recruit the precise combination of disgruntled patrons to join him on a one-night quest to save the world from the terminal threat of a rogue artificial intelligence.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":87101,\"title\":\"Terminator Genisys\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oZRVDpNtmHk8M1VYy1aeOWUXgbC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wvlIoof1FnKPLv9jAYanuP31V0C.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The year is 2029. John Connor, leader of the resistance continues the war against the machines. At the Los Angeles offensive, John's fears of the unknown future begin to emerge when TECOM spies reveal a new plot by SkyNet that will attack him from both fronts; past and future, and will ultimately change warfare forever.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":240832,\"title\":\"Lucy\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kRbpUTRNm6QbLQFPFWUcNC4czEm.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ozVwXlfxqNsariipatGwa5px3Pm.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A woman, accidentally caught in a dark deal, turns the tables on her captors and transforms into a merciless warrior evolved beyond human logic.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":588228,\"title\":\"The Tomorrow War\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/34nDCQZwaEvsy4CFO5hkGRFDCVU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yizL4cEKsVvl17Wc1mGEIrQtM2F.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The world is stunned when a group of time travelers arrive from the year 2051 to deliver an urgent message: Thirty years in the future, mankind is losing a global war against a deadly alien species. The only hope for survival is for soldiers and civilians from the present to be transported to the future and join the fight. Among those recruited is high school teacher and family man Dan Forester. Determined to save the world for his young daughter, Dan teams up with a brilliant scientist and his estranged father in a desperate quest to rewrite the fate of the planet.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":7551,\"title\":\"Déjà Vu\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wJAz3m9kTbdTWfQ2ZJEFojWKeoj.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mhi2fRCbEXtN43FNiq45WQg0DFe.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Called in to recover evidence in the aftermath of a horrific explosion on a New Orleans ferry, Federal agent Doug Carlin gets pulled away from the scene and taken to a top-secret government lab that uses a time-shifting surveillance device to help prevent crime.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"s_Xzu_Nfysc\",\"name\":\"In Exile (aka Time Runner) 1993 trailer starring Mark Hamill\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}